{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1745685240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/it_features.png?t=1745685240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/captivating.png?t=1745685240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk in the shoes of Detective Hindsight to explore Sin City and its residents. Who knows what anyone\u2019s hiding behind the scenes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/walking_gif.gif?t=1745685240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/investigation.png?t=1745685240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 intriguing cases to sink your investigative teeth into. Explore unique time periods and places at your own pace, using logic to unfurl the mysteries within. Highlight, scribble, and drag clues to deduce what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/investigation_gif.gif?t=1745685240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2982950/extras/cast.png?t=1745685240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and interact with jaded police officers, gambling nuns and most importantly your (unofficial) sleuthing sidekick: Phoebe, who seems to know a little too much about the crimes that happen around the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\